ninja q0: install the static embed library on Darwin, too

Upstream build.zig skips installing GhosttyLib artifacts on Darwin because
the official macOS consumer is the xcodebuild-produced xcframework
(macos/Ghostty.xcodeproj); see the in-tree comment "we don't currently
build on macOS this way". ninja q0 consumes the static embed archive
directly from `zig build` (the cmux route: one combined
libghostty-internal.a statically linked into the Rust host), so this patch
also installs the static library and the public embed header (ghostty.h)
on Darwin. Shared-lib install and non-Darwin paths are untouched.

Applied by vendor/ghostty/build.sh (idempotent).

--- a/build.zig
+++ b/build.zig
@@ -200,6 +200,13 @@
                 lib_shared.install("ghostty-internal.so");
                 lib_static.install("ghostty-internal.a");
             }
+        } else {
+            // ninja q0: install the static embed library + public header on
+            // Darwin. Upstream doesn't install via zig on macOS (official
+            // route is the xcodebuild xcframework); ninja links the combined
+            // static archive straight into the Rust host (cmux route).
+            lib_static.installHeader();
+            lib_static.install("libghostty-internal.a");
         }
     }
 
